<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98962" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφῡλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of the same stock</i> or
				<i>race with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ μέλιτται καὶ τὰ ς. ζῷα ταύταις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					682b10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ σύμφυλοι</span>
			<i>his congeners</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				101.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>of the same class with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρονταί
				τε καὶ ἀστραπαὶ . . καὶ τἆλλα ἃ δὴ τούτοις ἐστὶ
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				394a19
			</span></i>; <i>cognaie, suitable</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νομή,
				τροφή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.729c
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				991b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				661e
			</span></i>; of digested food, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφυλοτέραν τῷ ζῴῳ γενομένην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.303
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ς. τῷ σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.137b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -ότατον [τῷ
			ἀνθρώπῳ</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Vit.</u>
				p.28
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ς. ἡμῖν οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					124
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἡ νόησις τῷ μερισμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					146
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συμφύλων </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φίλων</span> cod.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χειρῶν
				προσαφῇ </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς
			ἁφήν</span> cod.) <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλποντα</span>
			(translated <i>cum quodam calidarum manuum amplexu</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cael.Aur.
				<u>TP</u>
				3.22
			</span></i>) <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.28
			</span></i> (dub.).</div>
